<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mot de passe oublié — PathFinder</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{height:100%;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}
body{min-height:100vh;background:#09090f;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.card{width:100%;max-width:460px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:24px;padding:40px}
h1{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-size:24px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}
p{color:rgba(232,230,240,.65);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6}
label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(232,230,240,.6);margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
input{width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#e8e6f0;outline:none}
.btn{margin-top:14px;width:100%;padding:13px;border:none;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6C63FF,#9D6BFF);color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.msg{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px}
.err{background:rgba(226,75,74,.12);border:.5px solid rgba(226,75,74,.35);color:#f87171}
.ok{background:rgba(29,158,117,.12);border:.5px solid rgba(29,158,117,.35);color:#34d399}
a{color:#9D6BFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <h1>Mot de passe oublié</h1>
  <p>Entrez votre adresse email. Si un compte existe, nous vous enverrons un lien sécurisé de réinitialisation.</p>

  {% for m in app.flashes('error') %}<div class="msg err">{{ m }}</div>{% endfor %}
  {% for m in app.flashes('success') %}<div class="msg ok">{{ m }}</div>{% endfor %}

  <form method="post" novalidate>
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('forgot_password') }}">
    <label for="email">Adresse email</label>
    <input id="email" type="email" name="email" value="{{ email|default('') }}" required placeholder="exemple@email.com">

    {% if recaptcha_site_key is not empty %}
      <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;justify-content:center">
        <div class="g-recaptcha" data-sitekey="{{ recaptcha_site_key }}"></div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <button class="btn" type="submit">Envoyer le lien</button>
  </form>

  <div style="margin-top:14px">
    <a href="{{ path('auth_login') }}">Retour à la connexion</a>
  </div>
</div>

{% if recaptcha_site_key is not empty %}
<script src="https://www.google.com/recaptcha/api.js" async defer></script>
{% endif %}
</body>
</html>
